OL,3,GNEWSACrime victims urged to know their
OL,4,Arights
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Wolverhampton are being
OL,7,Fencouraged to learn about the support
OL,8,Favailable if they become victims of
OL,9,Fcrime.
OL,11,FA campaign is promoting the Victims'
OL,12,FCode, which sets out the rights and
OL,13,Fminimum standards of service victims
OL,14,Fshould receive from criminal justice
OL,15,Fagencies.
OL,17,FOver the coming weeks, adverts carrying
OL,18,Fthe message"Victim? Don't lose sight of
OL,19,Fyour rights" will appear on mobile
OL,20,Fphones, digital billboards and on buses
OL,21,Fand trains across the West Midlands.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
