OL,3,GNEWSACrime victims urged to know their
OL,4,Arights
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe campaign is backed by the City of
OL,7,FWolverhampton Council as well as
OL,8,FNatalie Queiroz, the West Midlands'
OL,9,FVictims' Advocate, who survived an
OL,10,Fattempted murder in 2016 and now works
OL,11,Fto champion the rights of victims and
OL,12,Fsurvivors.
